# 统一换行：仓库里一律存 LF，工作区检出 LF（Windows 上也别变 CRLF，
# 否则从插件本体目录同步代码时每个文件都会假报 modified）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不要做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
